          "id": "steps-to-build-a-rest-app-in-spring-boot",
          "heading": "Steps to Build a REST App in Spring Boot:",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": true,
              "items": [
                "Create Spring Boot project with dependencies: spring-boot-starter-web",
                "Annotate with @RestController",
                "Map URIs using @RequestMapping or @GetMapping, etc.",
                "Use @RequestBody for incoming data and @ResponseBody for responses",
                "Run the application (embedded Tomcat)"
              ]
            },
